{"title":"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solutions_4_and_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions 4 and 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are distinct nonzero real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02342d06806b85e72feaac3f8bd964c8fb287baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\tfrac{2}{x} = y + \\tfrac{2}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"109\" height=\"23\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/2987c7cfe5a02f985818a451cc041f14c8a607a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"357\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce1116bf04a0080cbdb485eed39c744716079f3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\tfrac{2}{x}= y+\\tfrac{2}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"109\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c58076da60877943813920a227ed36b6a911d24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\not=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, we may assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34323e4c3544e3e4dba6ecbe6d82e00faaa0fca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{2}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" /> and/or, equivalently, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33bf4b1920ea89631271d845fa91c32fe487941.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{2}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Cross multiply in either equation, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4ccfb3fe8a8b7bfb7bace3e932d0a18a3a659f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d662ddb01064fc70caf47984c2ae346e7c733dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce1116bf04a0080cbdb485eed39c744716079f3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\tfrac{2}{x}= y+\\tfrac{2}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"109\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71309b285d57119917c021ed8dc1f3c3e9e63d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y+\\frac{2}{x}-\\frac{2}{y} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/c/afc2931facfc960fd9d17d3515a6a60750ef78c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)+2(\\frac{y-x}{xy}) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"183\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/f/2bf4978c07b3950268956355d1fb3c1ff40a6fe7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)(1-\\frac{2}{xy})=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"158\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c58076da60877943813920a227ed36b6a911d24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\not=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8401130db9dae14b494c64cdd03a5fc688f7a273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = \\frac{2}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"59\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/7/9779311aab441e4a55cba407f9bec73868f0030a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/898b48dd1064cf3808d54f36ca5772ad81211911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = x + \\frac{2}{x} = y + \\frac{2}{y}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"161\" height=\"42\" /> Consider the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531f76440557c2264bbf85191233815ac42e4bc3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u + \\frac{2}{u} = A.\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> Reorganizing, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b0847d15dd2bad446e686191b5192bd385c174fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u^2 - Au + 2 = 0.\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"17\" /> Notice that there can be at most two distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> which satisfy this equation, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are two distinct possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/d/ccd3c78be1c29e0097baa8b6322ee1ff82b9d86f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u.$\" width=\"14\" height=\"8\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are roots of this quadratic, and by Vieta’s formulas we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> thereby must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba6f5aab268739c63b4c45afb8c209432dcb1e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~ Professor-Mom\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions_4_and_5\">Solutions 4 and 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions 4 and 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/210dafbc1de49d2a664c6dcf0927cc1f66b31918.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + \\frac{2}{x} = y + \\frac{2}{y}.\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Multiply both sides by xy to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/3/b4331a43a95fad932a1efe5df151f2830a9e68fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2y + 2y = y^2x +2x\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Rearrange to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da55b3aeab33d1d85867278eb89e87765ab293ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2y - y^2x = 2x - 2y\\]\" width=\"160\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Factor out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> on the left side and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on the right side to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/1/f91a2f5f62fbf36065722fd2fc36d7a581c267fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy(x-y) = 2(x-y)\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d4d32572cbcecb17e77eaac1354e9b3ffb757e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> {You can do this since x and y are distinct} to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d662ddb01064fc70caf47984c2ae346e7c733dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>Solution 5:(sorry I don’t know how to open a new section whoever sees this next pls help!)\n(This is not a rigorous solution but it is extremely quick)(no I am not the person who wrote solution 4)\n</p><p>Question states x+2/x =y+2/y. Simply let x equal 1, y equal two. It satisfies because 3=3. Since it didn’t specify any further, we may realize immediately that xy=1*2= <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d662ddb01064fc70caf47984c2ae346e7c733dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Nyx3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1129\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1129</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CCjcMVtkVaQ\">https://youtu.be/CCjcMVtkVaQ</a>\n~sugar_rush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A\">2013 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017231802\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 304/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7140/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.842      1 -total\n 58.67%    7.534      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.94%    5.000      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11703:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017231802 and revision id 289841. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}